[0.001, "o", "\u001b[34m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mWorker network access?\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[36m❯ Restricted (recommended) — common registries only (npm, GitHub, PyPI)\u001b[39m\r\n  Open — workers can access any domain\r\n  Isolated — workers have no internet access\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m↑↓\u001b[22m \u001b[2mnavigate\u001b[22m\u001b[2m • \u001b[22m\u001b[1m⏎\u001b[22m \u001b[2mselect\u001b[22m\u001b[?25l\u001b[23G"]
